<% const format=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US'),interval=locals.billingInterval==='annual'?'annual':'monthly',compared=offer.comparison(plans),usage=new Set(['ai_work_credits','incoming_emails','emails_sent','connected_operations','api_requests']),packLabel=category=>({ai_work_credits:'AI Work Credits',incoming_emails:'incoming emails',emails_sent:'outgoing recipients',connected_operations:'Connected Operations'}[category]||category); %>
<div class="pro-pricing">
<section class="pricing-intro"><div><p class="pub-kicker">Pricing</p><h1>Choose a plan that fits your business</h1><p>Connect your existing systems, manage inventory and review the work StockChief prepares. Every paid plan includes production-supported connection categories. Higher plans add intelligence, automation and scale.</p></div><nav aria-label="Billing interval"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=monthly" <%- interval==='monthly'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Monthly</a><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=annual" <%- interval==='annual'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Annual billing</a></nav></section>
<% const chosenPlan=compared.find(plan=>planNavigation.state(plan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,selection:locals.planSelection,interval,checkoutOpen}).kind==='selected');if(chosenPlan){ %><p class="pub-notice" data-selected-plan-notice><%= chosenPlan.name %> is selected. <a href="<%= planNavigation.destination(chosenPlan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,interval,checkoutOpen}) %>">Continue with <%= chosenPlan.name %></a>. A selection does not activate a subscription.</p><% } %>
<% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><p class="pub-notice">Plan changes are paused right now. Please <a href="/support">contact support</a>. No payment will be taken.</p><% } %>
<% if(checkoutCancelled){ %><p class="pub-notice">Checkout was cancelled. No subscription was activated.</p><% } %>
<section class="plan-ladder plan-comparison" aria-label="StockChief plans">
<% for(const plan of compared){const team=plan.allowances.find(a=>a.meter==='members'),price=interval==='annual'?plan.annual_amount_minor:plan.monthly_amount_minor; %>
<article class="plan-card <%= plan.is_recommended?'is-recommended':'' %>" id="<%= plan.id %>" data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" data-monthly-minor="<%= plan.monthly_amount_minor??'' %>" data-annual-minor="<%= plan.annual_amount_minor??'' %>" data-offer-version="<%= plan.active_plan_version_id||'' %>">
<header><h2><%= plan.name %></h2><% if(plan.is_recommended){ %><span class="plan-popular">Most popular</span><% } %></header>
<p class="plan-promise"><%= plan.sales_only?'Capacity and service agreed for your business.':team?.units!=null?'For a team of up to '+format(team.units)+' people.':'Room for your business to grow.' %></p>
<div class="plan-price"><% if(plan.sales_only||price==null){ %><strong>Agreed pricing</strong><small>Tell us what your business needs</small><% }else{ %><strong>$<%= format(Number(price)/100) %></strong><span>/<%= interval==='annual'?'year':'month' %></span><small data-price-note><%= interval==='annual'?'Annual charge, paid yearly':'Billed monthly' %></small><% } %></div>
<div class="plan-card__action"><% const action=planNavigation.state(plan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,selection:locals.planSelection,interval,checkoutOpen});if(action.disabled){ %><button class="pub-btn" type="button" disabled aria-disabled="true" data-plan-state="<%= action.kind %>"><%= action.label %></button><% }else{ %><a class="pub-btn" data-plan-link data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" href="<%= action.href %>"><%= action.label %></a><% } %></div>
<ul class="plan-allowances"><% for(const a of plan.allowances){const number=plan.sales_only?'Contract limit':a.units==null?'Contact support':a.meter==='storage_bytes'?format(a.units/1e9)+' GB':format(a.units); %><li data-allowance="<%= a.meter %>" aria-label="<%= number+' '+a.label %>"><span><%= a.label %><%= usage.has(a.meter)?' / month':'' %></span><strong><%= number %></strong></li><% } %></ul>
<% if(plan.configuration?.syncIntervalSeconds){ %><p>Scheduled connection checks from every <%= format(plan.configuration.syncIntervalSeconds/60) %> minute<%= plan.configuration.syncIntervalSeconds===60?'':'s' %>, subject to provider limits. Supported webhooks can arrive sooner.</p><% } %>
<p class="plan-includes"><%= plan.includesPlan?'Everything in '+plan.includesPlan+', plus':'Includes' %></p><ul class="plan-features"><% for(const feature of plan.incrementalFeatures){ %><li data-plan-feature="<%= feature.capability %>"><%= feature.text %></li><% } %><% if(!plan.incrementalFeatures.length){ %><li>Capacity and service defined in your agreement.</li><% } %></ul>
</article><% } %></section>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">A product can have many variants. Each active combination of up to three options counts as one SKU. Option names and values are yours to choose. One product with 10 variants and 100,000 units counts as 1 product and 10 SKUs. There is no plan-based cap on units of stock; quantity precision and exact-value safeguards apply.</p>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Products, SKUs, people, inventories, connections, usage and storage are shared across the account. Warehouses, bins and custom roles are counted per inventory. Pending invitations occupy a person slot. Archived records retain their history and stored data. Row allowances apply per import; file-size and format limits also apply. Use CSV for the largest imports. Storage measures uncompressed business data and original attachments in decimal GB, excluding shared indexes, backups and service telemetry.</p>
<div class="plan-footer"><span>14-day money-back guarantee</span><span>Unused included AI credits roll over one month</span><span>Usage alerts at 80%, 95% and 100%</span><span>Cancel anytime</span></div>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">AI Work Credits pay for AI work. Incoming email processing counts unique accepted messages; outgoing sending counts recipients; Connected Operations count committed external business changes. Ordinary browsing, manual work, polling, API pagination and provider retries do not consume Connected Operations. An AI question or action can require several steps and credits. Its email or external action uses the separately listed allowance. API requests and delivered webhooks have their own resource allowance, with no automatic overage billing.</p>
<section class="pro-addons"><h2>Add more when you need it</h2><p class="pro-pricing-note">Purchased usage lasts 12 months. Auto top-up stays off until you choose a pack and a monthly spending cap. Add-ons and packs require verified billing setup.</p><div class="pro-addon-grid">
<% for(const pack of offerPacks){ %><article data-pack="<%= pack.id %>" data-pack-amount-minor="<%= pack.amount_minor %>"><strong><%= format(pack.units) %> <%= packLabel(pack.category) %></strong><span>$<%= format(Number(pack.amount_minor)/100) %></span></article><% } %>
<% for(const product of capacityProducts){ %><article><strong><%= product.label %></strong><span>$<%= format(Number(product.monthly_amount_minor)/100) %>/month</span><% if(!product.stripe_price_id){ %><small>Billing setup pending</small><% } %></article><% } %></div></section>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Shipping postage and merchant card fees are billed by your connected provider. Customer payment connections are included on paid plans where production-supported and require provider setup. <a href="/integrations">Check each provider's supported operations and availability</a>. Custom ERP connections require agreed mappings and qualification; an integration category does not promise every vendor or operation.</p>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Upgrades unlock after confirmed payment and start a new billing month. Eligible downgrades start at the end of your paid term. Existing records and accepted credit grants are preserved. A qualifying subscription refund cancels renewal, provides 30 days of read-only export access, then deletes workspace data. <a href="/terms">Read the subscription terms</a>.</p>
</div><script src="/plan-selection.js" defer></script>
